      ],
      "description": "<p>Each day, a vegetable lamb grows <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> edible flowers (such as artichoke, broccoli, or dandelion) among the green cotton covering its body. These vegetables can be picked without hurting the lamb. A living creature can eat the vegetable with an Interact action to regain <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6+4</span> healing Hit Points.</p>",
